# C4 nivel 2 — contenedores de ArnesIA (D2; render: `d2 container.d2 container.svg`, binario Go único)
# Fuente única as code. Los boundaries de arch/boundaries/ enforçan las flechas prohibidas.

title: {
  label: "ArnesIA — contenedores (C4 nivel 2)"
  near: top-center
}

operador: "Operador" {shape: person}

shell: "Shell Tauri 2\n(ventana · tray · updater · deep-link · firma)" {
  style.fill: "#eef2ff"
  launcher: "launcher\n(attach-o-spawnea daemon · env Mint DMABUF · single-instance)"
  webview: "WebView (webkit2gtk 4.1)\ncarga la SPA go:embed"
}

daemon: "arnesia (daemon Go único)" {
  style.fill: "#ecfdf5"

  spa: "SPA Vite+React (go:embed)\nReact Flow 12 · Zustand+hash · assistant-ui · CodeMirror6+merge"

  transport: "Transporte\nHTTP + SSE multiplexado (event: map|dock|run)" {
    style.fill: "#fff7ed"
  }

  core: "Core (dominio + casos de uso)\ngrafo agnóstico · spine de estados · contratos\nNO importa transporte/store/shell/agente-concreto" {
    style.fill: "#fef9c3"
  }

  ports: "Puertos\nAgentPort · GraphStore · RunStore · EventBus"

  adapters: "Adaptadores" {
    agentcc: "agent/claudecode\nsubproceso stream-json + OTel"
    index: "index/sqlite (modernc, WAL)\níndice DESECHABLE"
    watch: "watch (fsnotify + reader por offset)"
    publish: "publish (marketplace git)"
  }
}

claude: "Claude Code CLI (local)" {shape: hexagon; style.fill: "#f3e8ff"}
jsonl: "~/.claude/**/*.jsonl\nFUENTE DE VERDAD" {shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#fee2e2"}
otel: "OTel endpoint (en el daemon)" {shape: queue}

operador -> shell.webview: "usa"
shell.launcher -> daemon: "attach/spawn :4200"
shell.webview -> daemon.transport: "HTTP/SSE"
daemon.spa -> daemon.transport: "consume (misma build en dev-browser y Tauri)"
daemon.transport -> daemon.core: "traduce request<->caso-de-uso"
daemon.core -> daemon.ports: "depende de interfaces"
daemon.adapters.agentcc -> daemon.ports: "implementa AgentPort" {style.stroke-dash: 3}
daemon.adapters.index -> daemon.ports: "implementa GraphStore/RunStore" {style.stroke-dash: 3}
daemon.adapters.agentcc -> claude: "dirige (conductor)"
claude -> jsonl: "escribe"
claude -> otel: "hooks/skills/tool_decision"
daemon.adapters.watch -> jsonl: "indexa (enumera/replaya)"
daemon.adapters.agentcc -> otel: "recibe sidechannel"

prohibido: "Flechas PROHIBIDAS (enforçadas por arch/fitness):\n core -> shell · core -> transport · core -> database/sql · core -> claudecode concreto" {
  near: bottom-center
  style: {fill: "#fef2f2"; stroke: "#dc2626"; font-color: "#991b1b"}
}
